### Rota Raiz do App
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Lista todos os Users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Insere um novo User
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tat",
  "email": "tatiana@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Insere um novo User
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wladimir",
  "email": "wladimir@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Lista um User específico
GET http://localhost:3000/users/f54b47d8-8b9d-48f6-a427-fe7e983f44aa


### Atualiza um User específico
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/f54b47d8-8b9d-48f6-a427-fe7e983f44aa
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wladimir Santos",
  "email": "wladimir@example.com"
}

### Deleta um User específico
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/e2ee01ee-6ccc-4976-b587-2b839a825c19
